  <bpmn:collaboration id="L4_08_COLLAB" name="Archive deviation records">
    <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Model: L4-08
Title: Archive deviation records
Parent: L3 A8
Interface: start S1; ends E1; message flows M1
Rule exception: ROL-03 P_INV - D1 (orchestrator default, 06 Nov 2026): Investigator/institution is an expanded pool on all levels because investigator obligations are binding steps that must appear as tasks
Open item: [verify] US sponsor record retention (21 CFR 312.57) not extracted by R4 (C-23); no US sponsor retention task is modelled.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="L4_08_P_SPON" name="Sponsor" processRef="L4_08_P_SPON_PROCESS">
      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 GL:Sponsor (p. printed 90 / PDF 98); EUCTR Art. 47 (p. OJ L 158/39); 21CFR312 21CFR312.50 (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination); E6R3 P3.1 (p. printed 4 / PDF 12); E6R3 A1-3.9.2 (p. printed 26 / PDF 34); E6R3 P10.1 (p. printed 7 / PDF 15); E6R3 P10.3 (p. printed 7 / PDF 15); E6R3 A1-3.9.5 (p. printed 27 / PDF 35); E6R3 A2-3.8 (p. printed 62 / PDF 70); EMA-SB SGlossary (p. printed 3/21); TCB-RBQM SQTL-Process (p. journal pp. 251-261 (section page not confirmed))</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:extensionElements>
        <ipd:trace>
          <ipd:source key="E6R3" loc="GL:Sponsor" page="printed 90 / PDF 98"/>
          <ipd:source key="EUCTR" loc="Art. 47" page="OJ L 158/39"/>
