      <bpmn:documentation textFormat="text/plain">Sources: E6R3 GL:Regulatory Authorities (p. printed 89 / PDF 97); EUCTR Art. 2(2)(12) (p. OJ L 158/12); 21CFR312 21CFR312.56(b) (p. n/a - eCFR web text without pagination)</bpmn:documentation>
